    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im disappearing. like there isnt even a person left in here anymore, just a set of tasks and chores for everyone else. i wake up and it’s already someone else’s turn to need something from me. i don't even recognize myself in the mirror. it just feels so heavy all the time... like i'm drowning in everything i have to do.",
